{"id":"n30159-2-3","stage":1,"title":"옷 · 指沾或贴在食物表面上的。","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30159-2-3-1","ko":"엄마, 제가 도울 일 없어요?","zh":"妈妈，我没有需要帮忙的地方吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도울","meaning":"帮，帮助","explanation":"돕다：帮，帮助；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"돕다","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17203","senseId":"1","lemma":"돕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어요?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"7feaaecf170e0c6a","term":"돕다","zh":"帮，帮助","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3","entryId":"17203","definition":"给别人正在做的事打下手或添帮手。","pronunciation":["돕ː따"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/bc6ac4c07ff854b441c9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30159-2-3-2","ko":"새우에 튀김 가루 옷을 묻혀 주렴.","zh":"把炸粉裹在虾身上吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새우에","meaning":"虾","explanation":"새우：虾；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"새우","audio":"/audio/fd7862fa6687a6088a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63367","senseId":"1","lemma":"새우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"튀김","meaning":"油炸食品","explanation":"튀김：油炸食品","readings":[{"term":"튀김","audio":"/audio/a0b9e6d18fa4c97ed0ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82383","senseId":"1","lemma":"튀김","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가루","meaning":"粉末，面儿","explanation":"가루：粉末，面儿","readings":[{"term":"가루","audio":"/audio/42864a47196d1d848539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65209","senseId":"1","lemma":"가루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷을","meaning":"指沾或贴在食物表面上的。","explanation":"옷：指沾或贴在食物表面上的。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"2","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"묻혀","meaning":"沾上，染上","explanation":"묻히다：沾上，染上；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"묻히다","audio":"/audio/28120c6c18d8503b1de4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15725","senseId":"1","lemma":"묻히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주렴.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fd7862fa6687a608","term":"새우","zh":"虾","audio":"/audio/fd7862fa6687a6088a81.mp3","entryId":"